  "hindi": "तुमसे विजेता, पुरस्कार लाने वाला, महान्, सहायता करने वाला, सच्चे बल वाला उत्पन्न होता है। तुमसे धन, देवों द्वारा प्रेरित, आनन्द देने वाला; तुमसे तीव्र, दौड़ता हुआ घोड़ा, हे अग्नि।",
  "english": "From you is born the prize-winner, the prize-bringer, the great one, the help-maker, of true vigour. From you wealth, impelled by the gods, bringing delight; from you the swift, speeding steed, O Agni.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "abhiṣṭikṛt \"help-maker\" is a loose rendering of a compound whose first member abhiṣṭi (\"help, superiority\") is not certain. vihāyāḥ \"vast, great\". mayobhūḥ \"bringing delight\" (mayas \"delight\"). In Hindi विजेता renders vājin (prize-winner).",
  "confidence": "medium"
